    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Hourz is a survival game set in a dark and dangerous post-apocalyptic world. A deadly virus has not only wiped out much of humanity but has left the remaining survivors in a desperate struggle for resources and survival. As the player, you must guide a family through 22 days of life-or-death challenges, facing not only zombies but also bandits and other dangers that lurk in this grim world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings a new test, and every choice you make will shape the family's chances of survival. Strategy and resource management are key, as food, water, and bullets have become the new currency in this broken world.\u00a0Can you make it to the last 22 hours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Survive in a zombie-infested post-apocalyptic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Experience rich character-driven dialogues and an immersive storyline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Gather resources, fight zombies, and make strategic decisions to keep your family alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple choices and endings based on your decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 High replayability with intense and atmospheric gameplay.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dead Hourz is a survival game set in a dark and dangerous post-apocalyptic world. A deadly virus has not only wiped out much of humanity but has left the remaining survivors in a desperate struggle for resources and survival. As the player, you must guide a family through 22 days of life-or-death challenges, facing not only zombies but also bandits and other dangers that lurk in this grim world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day brings a new test, and every choice you make will shape the family's chances of survival. Strategy and resource management are key, as food, water, and bullets have become the new currency in this broken world.\u00a0Can you make it to the last 22 hours?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Survive in a zombie-infested post-apocalyptic world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Experience rich character-driven dialogues and an immersive storyline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Gather resources, fight zombies, and make strategic decisions to keep your family alive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Multiple choices and endings based on your decisions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 High replayability with intense and atmospheric gameplay.</p>",
